    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfe8 Introduction\ud83c\udfe8</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2728 As the owner, build the ultimate inn!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc8e Increase satisfaction, customer appeal, and reputation to attract more guests and expand your inn\u2019s facilities!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb2 Experience tons of random events in your daily management, keeping the gameplay fresh every time!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0f Take on monster-hunting quests to earn funds for your inn! Enjoy it as a full-fledged battle game too!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc95 Countless naughty encounters with the female adventurers staying at your inn \ud83d\udc95</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc51 As your inn grows, a variety of female adventurers will come to stay!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf1f Deepen your bonds with them\u2014go on monster hunts together or enjoy some steamy moments...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc97 11 female adventurers available for naughty scenes! 53 total H-scenes with 5 scenes per character on average! Over 160 CGs and a scenario volume about 3 times larger than the previous game Dungeon Desire!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461630/extras/967adf71e5a0051b72ae2a9bf05fa1df.avif?t=1752894348\" data-has-big width=800 height=554 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc98 Pure love-focused H-scenes! This time, we\u2019ve emphasized character differentiation, tailoring diverse H-scenes to each character\u2019s appearance and personality!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udccb Game Specs &amp; Details \ud83d\udccb</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae Game Genre</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inn Management Simulation RPG</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc93 H-Scene Details  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >H-Compatible Female Characters: 11  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >H-Scenes: 53\uff08160+ HCGs\uff09  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Voice: Voiced H-scenes  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Screen Size: 1280x720</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u23f1\ufe0f Estimated Playtime</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 10 hours</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f Convenient Systems \ud83d\udee0\ufe0f</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\uddbc\ufe0f Illustration Motion Feature: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adds immersion to H-scenes with dynamic illustrations!  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcdd Text Features: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Includes text skip, auto mode (adjustable speed), quick save/load, log history, ejaculation countdown, scenario progress tracker, and temporary window hiding.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd04 Event Replay Mode: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Revisit viewed H-scenes and CGs anytime, with an option to unlock all unviewed events.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc40 Character Portrait Viewing Mode: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize and enjoy your favorite character\u2019s portrait with options like expressions, outfits, and backgrounds. Edit text to display your preferred dialogue!  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd16 Auto-Battle Mode: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For players who find combat tedious or want to save time, a high-performance AI auto-battle system is included (with detailed settings like full auto, partial auto, or auto for weak enemies only).  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd31 Ultimate Equipment System: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Change the criteria for \u201cultimate equipment\u201d (attack-focused, magic-focused, defense-focused) and switch your entire party\u2019s gear to the best equipment with one button.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf08 Cheat Mode: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For those who find battle content bothersome, features like auto-completing monster-hunting quests are available.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additionally, an \u201cH-scene auto-skip function\u201d for focused gameplay and an \u201cH-scene illustration skip function\u201d for instant access to steamy visuals are included.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2699\ufe0f Config Options: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fine-tune battle speed, gamepad/key bindings, sound settings, window colors, text speed, fonts, and more!</p></li></ul>",
