best equipment with one button.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf08 Cheat Mode: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For those who find battle content bothersome, features like auto-completing monster-hunting quests are available.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additionally, an \u201cH-scene auto-skip function\u201d for focused gameplay and an \u201cH-scene illustration skip function\u201d for instant access to steamy visuals are included.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2699\ufe0f Config Options: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fine-tune battle speed, gamepad/key bindings, sound settings, window colors, text speed, fonts, and more!</p></li></ul>",
